Package: datacaged
Title: CAGED Microdata Download and Storage in DuckDB
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexsandro", "Prado", email = "alexsandro.prado@ufersa.edu.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to download, parse, and store Brazilian CAGED 
    (Cadastro Geral de Empregados e Desempregados) microdata using DuckDB. 
    Supports both legacy CAGED (pre-2020), Novo CAGED (2020+), and adjustment files, 
    enabling efficient local storage and analysis workflows.
SystemRequirements: 7-Zip (optional, required for PPMd-compressed files from CAGED antigo and CAGED Ajustes)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: bzip2
Date: 2026-04-28
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    archive,
    cli,
    DBI,
    dplyr,
    duckdb,
    glue,
    purrr,
    readr (>= 2.1.0),
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
